        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Pair of knee-breeches of machine-knitted beige silk. Pattern of vertical stripes. At the top are nine flat white metal buttons. At each knee are three small buttons covered with the same-coloured silk, and linen tapes for tying. There is a linen band as lining at waist."@en , "Man's breeches, machine knitted beige silk, French, 1790s."@en ;
